{"route":"/docs/5.1/layout/containers/","version":"5.1","renderedVersion":"5.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Containers","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Containers are a fundamental building block of Bootstrap that contain, pad, and align your content within a given device or viewport."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-they-work","type":"heading","en":"How they work","level":2},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Containers are the most basic layout element in Bootstrap and are <strong>required when using our default grid system</strong>. Containers are used to contain, pad, and (sometimes) center the content within them. While containers <em>can</em> be nested, most layouts do not require a nested container."},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap comes with three different containers:"},{"id":"how-they-work--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>.container</code>, which sets a <code>max-width</code> at each responsive breakpoint"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>.container-fluid</code>, which is <code>width: 100%</code> at all breakpoints"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>.container-{breakpoint}</code>, which is <code>width: 100%</code> until the specified breakpoint"}]}]},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"The table below illustrates how each container’s <code>max-width</code> compares to the original <code>.container</code> and <code>.container-fluid</code> across each breakpoint."},{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"See them in action and compare them in our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/examples/grid/#containers\">Grid example</a>."},{"id":"how-they-work--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[]},{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Extra small<br>\n        &lt;576px"}]},{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"Small<br>\n        ≥576px"}]},{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"Medium<br>\n        ≥768px"}]},{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"Large<br>\n        ≥992px"}]},{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"X-Large<br>\n        ≥1200px"}]},{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"XX-Large<br>\n        ≥1400px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"row","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"540px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"720px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"960px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"1140px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"1320px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"row","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container-sm</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-20","type":"paragraph","en":"540px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-21","type":"paragraph","en":"720px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-22","type":"paragraph","en":"960px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-23","type":"paragraph","en":"1140px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-24","type":"paragraph","en":"1320px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"row","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-25","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container-md</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-26","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-27","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-28","type":"paragraph","en":"720px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-29","type":"paragraph","en":"960px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-30","type":"paragraph","en":"1140px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-31","type":"paragraph","en":"1320px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"row","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-32","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container-lg</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-33","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-34","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-35","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-36","type":"paragraph","en":"960px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-37","type":"paragraph","en":"1140px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-38","type":"paragraph","en":"1320px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"row","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-39","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container-xl</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-40","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-41","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-42","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-43","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-44","type":"paragraph","en":"1140px"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-45","type":"paragraph","en":"1320px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"row","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-46","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container-xxl</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-47","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-48","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-49","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-50","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-51","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-52","type":"paragraph","en":"1320px"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"row","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-53","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>.container-fluid</code>"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-54","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-55","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-56","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-57","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-58","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"how-they-work--paragraph-59","type":"paragraph","en":"100%"}]}]}]},{"id":"default-container","type":"heading","en":"Default container","level":2},{"id":"default-container--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Our default <code>.container</code> class is a responsive, fixed-width container, meaning its <code>max-width</code> changes at each breakpoint."},{"id":"default-container--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"container\">\n  <!-- Content here -->\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"responsive-containers","type":"heading","en":"Responsive containers","level":2},{"id":"responsive-containers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Responsive containers allow you to specify a class that is 100% wide until the specified breakpoint is reached, after which we apply <code>max-width</code>s for each of the higher breakpoints. For example, <code>.container-sm</code> is 100% wide to start until the <code>sm</code> breakpoint is reached, where it will scale up with <code>md</code>, <code>lg</code>, <code>xl</code>, and <code>xxl</code>."},{"id":"responsive-containers--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"container-sm\">100% wide until small breakpoint</div>\n<div class=\"container-md\">100% wide until medium breakpoint</div>\n<div class=\"container-lg\">100% wide until large breakpoint</div>\n<div class=\"container-xl\">100% wide until extra large breakpoint</div>\n<div class=\"container-xxl\">100% wide until extra extra large breakpoint</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"fluid-containers","type":"heading","en":"Fluid containers","level":2},{"id":"fluid-containers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use <code>.container-fluid</code> for a full width container, spanning the entire width of the viewport."},{"id":"fluid-containers--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n  ...\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"sass","type":"heading","en":"Sass","level":2},{"id":"sass--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"As shown above, Bootstrap generates a series of predefined container classes to help you build the layouts you desire. You may customize these predefined container classes by modifying the Sass map (found in <code>_variables.scss</code>) that powers them:"},{"id":"sass--code-1","type":"code","value":"$container-max-widths: (\n  sm: 540px,\n  md: 720px,\n  lg: 960px,\n  xl: 1140px,\n  xxl: 1320px\n);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to customizing the Sass, you can also create your own containers with our Sass mixin."},{"id":"sass--code-2","type":"code","value":"// Source mixin\n@mixin make-container($padding-x: $container-padding-x) {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding-right: $padding-x;\n  padding-left: $padding-x;\n  margin-right: auto;\n  margin-left: auto;\n}\n\n// Usage\n.custom-container {\n  @include make-container();\n}","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"For more information and examples on how to modify our Sass maps and variables, please refer to <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/layout/grid/#sass\">the Sass section of the Grid documentation</a>."}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rfs/"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rtl/"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contribute/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/overview/"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/sass/"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/options/"},